 "text": "Hello, how are things going? Very much normal. The muscles around your eyes get tired from constantly lifting one eyelid. They are. Sadly, there' no shortcut. They serve a purpose, believe me. Rest them as much as you can, and they' usually look better in a day or two. They can help a bit, especially at night. The problem with them is they look bit silly, so only use them if you need them.",
